  "The unsaved screen and session values as state machines (ADR-002 of Chapter 5.6): per region, the states (SM), the events (EV) and the transitions (TN) the requirements name. What a row holds and does not hold is table T-250 of docs/spec/05-07-design.md; the form of the machine is table T-249.",
